# First Order DSM
# The output average should be input / pow(2,DSM_L)
# The output will have DSM_Q bit for changing
--- Netlist
dsm_in --> integer_divide(pow(2, DSM_L+DSM_Q-1)) --> scaler(pow(2,DSM_Q-1)) --> net1
dsm_in --> modulus(pow(2,DSM_L+DSM_Q-1)) --> net2
net2, net5 --> sub --> net3
net3 --> integrator --> integer_divide(pow(2,DSM_L)) --> net4
net4 --> scaler(pow(2,DSM_L)) --> net5
net1, net4 --> add --> dsm_out
--- Pin
in: dsm_in
out: dsm_out
